.matsumura/img/2016/06/05/2990774/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも応援よろしくお願いします！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-13835":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポ書いてたら1日遅れちゃったけど\n佐々木琴子ちゃん誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギリギリ1日遅れ！\nいや、\nギリギリって言うのかどうなのか！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ朝に\n楽天スーパーセールのCM見たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうテレビで見た人いる？\n中田も一応いるから探してみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/29/8749893/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや\n今日の朝レッスン行く前\n電車の吊り広告も見たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特設サイトで\n自分たちで作ったムービーもあるので\n良かったら見てね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/29/8749893/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/29/8749893/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から\n中田、真夏、若月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は明日に向けて\nレッスンだったよ(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、明日はZeppTokyo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち位置は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼 どっちも同じくらい行く\n夜 若干上手が多め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じでーす＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"typ